{
  "info": {
    "name": "Hackarun - Estacionamento Inteligente",
    "description": "Colecao da v2.0 (Equipe 43 - Aerodactyle). Pre-condicao: banco recem-criado (apague data/capimparking.db e suba a API) e execucao em SEQUENCIA no Collection Runner/Newman. Variaveis encadeadas: ticketId, ticketPlaca, ticketCobrado, vagaSugerida. Fora do escopo (Won't): POST /setores, GET /setores/{id}/vagas e cenarios de carga.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Setup & Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('database=connected', () => pm.expect(j.database).to.eql('connected'));",
                  "pm.test('status healthy', () => pm.expect(j.status).to.eql('healthy'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
